## Summary

Shipped a production-polished, Apple-idiomatic **`HealthRow`** shared surface at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/HealthRow.*` — faithful SwiftUI parity of `web/src/components/status/HealthRow.tsx`.

**What the web source is:** a pure presentational leaf (the prompt itself records *Data sources: none*). It renders a status dot, optional glyph, truncating label, status-tinted summary, and a chevron iff `(to || onClick)`, wrapped as `<a target=_blank>` / `<Link to>` / `<button onClick>` / `<div>`.

